            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"interpretation-and-next-test\">Interpretation and next test</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The project established an evaluator-ready comparison, not an empirical\nconfirmation. A future continuation should first run both prepared\ncheckpoint evaluations on the same backend. If evaluator fidelity is\nestablished, the decisive causal test is a matched 160-update GRPO and\nSEED training comparison from the same hindsight-skill SFT checkpoint.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Sources</strong></span>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.14777\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Paper</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/jinyangwu/SEED\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Authors' code</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/Jinyang23/Seed-AlfWorld-3B\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Released checkpoint</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/alphaXiv/seed-self-evolving-on-policy-distillation-for-ag/blob/main/reports/seed_reproduction/report.md\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Detailed report</a></li>\n</ul></span>"
